<title>ESTONIA: KALEV H1 NET PROFIT 17.3 MILLION KROONS.</title>
<headline>KALEV H1 NET PROFIT 17.3 MILLION KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First six months of 1997</p>
<p>				   (million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				   17.3 vs   5.7</p>
<p> Turnover				    173.2 vs 138.4</p>
<p> General adminstrative costs	    14.8 vs  13.8</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			    23.3  vs   7.4</p>
<p>NOTE -- Kalev confectionary also set a 1997 profit forecast</p>
<p>of 30 million kroons.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
